      "name": "Corrupt the Mind (DC 18)",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/telepathy.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>As an attack action, satanic ichor can dominate any creature it can contact telepathically (as the domination psionic power manifested by a 10th-level Telepath). A successful @Check[save:will|dc:18]{Will save (DC 18)} negates the effect and protects the creature against further domination attempts by the satanic ichor for 24 hours. Satanic ichor trapped within a container will typically use a dominated creature to break the container that confines it. Freed satanic ichor will typically use a dominated creature as a vessel (see below) or thrall to attract other potential thralls.</p>",
        "source": "Menace Manual",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/menacecreat4.html",
